  <ab>
                    <lb n="01"/>
                    <lb n=" T08n0232_0728a26" ed="T"/>
                    <app>
                        <lem/>
                        <rdg type="textcritical" wit="T_232_1 T_310">“復次</rdg>
                    </app>
                    <persName key="rh0001" reg="Sariputra" type="disciple of Buddha" xml:id="zh-a1" corresp="en-a1">
                        <supplied source="R1 Sun">舍</supplied>利弗</persName>！汝問：‘云何名<term ref="DFB10724">佛</term>？<lb n="02"/> 云何<term ref="DFB31466">觀佛</term>者？’<term ref="DFB04896">
                        <g>不</g>
                        <lb n=" T08n0232_0728a27" ed="T"/>生</term>、<g>不</g>
                    <term ref="DFB24470">滅</term>， <lb n="03"/>
                    <term ref="DFB05000">
                        <g>不</g>來、<g>不</g>去</term>，非<term ref="DFB09526">名</term>、非<term ref="DFB16497">相</term>，是 <lb n="04"/> 名<g>爲</g>佛。如自<lb n=" T08n0232_0728a28" ed="T"/>觀身<term ref="DFB26846">實相</term>， <lb n="05"/> 觀佛亦<g rend="variant">然</g>。<g>唯</g>有智者，乃 <lb n="06"/>
                    <g rend="variant">能</g>
                    <g rend="variant">知</g>耳，是<lb n=" T08n0232_0728a29" ed="T"/>名觀佛。” </ab>
      </div>
      <div type="translation" xml:lang="en"><p>“<persName corresp="zh-a2" key="rh0001" type="disciple of Buddha" xml:id="en-a2">
                        <foreign xml:lang="sa">Śāriputra</foreign>
                    </persName>, you ask, what is
                    it that is named the Buddha? How does one contemplate the Buddha? Not produced,
                    not extinguished; not come, not gone; not a name, not an attribute—this is
                    called the Buddha. As one contemplates the real attributes of one’s body, just
                    so one contemplates the Buddha. Only those with wisdom can understand this. This
                    is named contemplating the Buddha.” </p></div>
